  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grupo ELCATEX / San Juan Textiles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transaction consists of guaranteed long-term financing for Elcatex, S. de R.L. (henceforth, &#x201c;ELCATEX&#x201d;, &#x201c;the Company&#x201d; or &#x201c;the Client&#x201d;), a leading textile industry company in Honduras. The objectives of the Project are: (i) to support economic growth and export diversification; (ii) construction and fit out of a new textile plant (San Juan Textiles Project) located in San Juan Innovation Park, an Export Processing Zone (&#x201c;EPZ&#x201d;) in Choloma; (iii) purchase of sewing equipment; and (iv) to finance capital investment, working capital and liability restructuring to increase ELCATEX&#x2019;s production capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
